## Name of the node (change this dynamically when spinning up new Docker containers)
-sname aetherion_node_1

## The magic cookie for distributed security (Must be identical on all 7 billion user nodes)
-setcookie supersonic_aetherion_global_cookie

## Enable kernel poll and a few async threads for massive I/O scaling
+K true
+A 30

## Increase number of concurrent ports/sockets
-env ERL_MAX_PORTS 4096000
